Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:00.00,WhisprsWatermark,,0,0,0,,@Whisprs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.88,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We never know\Nhow much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.42,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}someone is holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.37,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}behind a polite\Nsmile or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.58,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a quiet glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:08.66,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The strongest people\Naren't the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.24,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ones who\Nnever broke...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.88,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the ones\Nwho learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.39,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to rebuild\Nin silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:15.62,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Be gentle with\Nwho you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.12,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.90,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sometimes, surviving\Nthe day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.23,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is their\Ngreatest victory.
